The '''Forgotten Skull''' is a [[Locations|Location]] in the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}} that is used similarly to the {{Zone|Dungeon Hub}}. It is where 4 players form a party to battle {{MobSprite|Kuudra}}. {{NPCSprite|Crag}} is near the back of the Skull, who sends players to {{Zone|Kuudra's Hollow}}, where Kuudra can be battled. This is part of the Main Crimson Isle Quest where {{NPCSprite|Elle}} tells the player to battle "The Monster".

